        "id": 7979,
        "name": "Pushingthelimits",
        "username": "Pushingthelimits",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/82dd89/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-16T00:46:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I got this idea while hearing about the game Cuthroat Caverns (which I have not played).</p><p>The main idea is that SotM is no longer cooperative, there will be one winner. The winner will be the hero who can land the killing blow to the villain. This will be the hero that brings the trophy to the world. This game is more \"Iron Man\" Tony Starks personality than it is \"Avengers Assemble.\" I understand that this is not in the spirit of the creation of the game, but I think it would be worth a spin. I can think of some scenarios developing that I will not share yet because I want to try them out.</p><p>The players could still all lose if they are all incapacitated or another villain or environment win condition happens. Any player that is incapacitated would still have their turn and could use an incapacitated power.</p><p>I have a great time playing regular games in the Google+ forum. Who would be up for trying this in that setting?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:23.033Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
