        "created_at": "2013-05-17T09:41:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It pretty much destroys the fun out of support characters I.E. Argent Adept isn't known for his killing blows. Thus this ain't for me but hey once you try it you tell me if it was as fun as you thought it would.</p>",
