        "raw": "<p>As much as I hate to say it, as I generally like quirky PvP variant rules, MedicTank is right. &nbsp;Support characters like Argent Adept, Visionary, Legacy, and even Mister Fixer would be at a decided disadvantage, as they have no end-of-game &quot;nova&quot; ability, and only deal damage in small, discrete chunks. Even Tempest would be at a disadvantage, as his highest unbuffed &nbsp;attack is what, 7 points? (Lightning Slash with Shackles out)</p><p>Much as it&#39;d be cool to see heroes going against one another--and it&#39;s a pretty common comics trope, see also: &nbsp;Civil War, Crisis on Infinite Earths, etc.--SotM just isn&#39;t currently set up that way. &nbsp;And when you&#39;re fighting against the intrinsic mechanics of the game, that&#39;s a battle you&#39;re never going to actually win, but just settle on.</p>",
